sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Initiator
    participant B as Responder
    participant O as Responder's owner
    A->>B: engage (purpose, owner, speaker: ai-agent, relation)
    Note over B: Check owner policy, assurance level,<br/>introduction credential (task WORKING)
    opt Outside owner policy
        B->>O: Ask owner
        O-->>B: Decision
    end
    alt Accept
        B-->>A: engage-response: accept (task INPUT_REQUIRED)
        Note over A,B: Initiator sends offer next
    else Conditions
        B-->>A: engage-response: conditions (task AUTH_REQUIRED)
        A->>B: present (delegation / identity credentials)
        B-->>A: engage-response: accept or decline
    else Decline
        B-->>A: engage-response: decline (task REJECTED)
    end
